<title>SOUTH KOREA: More S.Korean shipyards hit by strikes.</title>
<headline>More S.Korean shipyards hit by strikes.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four South Korean dockyards were hit by strikes called by unions on Thursday in protest at a new labour law, union officials said.</p>
<p>Workers at Hyundai Mipo Dockyards, Halla Heavy Industries and Hanjin Heavy Industries walked out, the officials said. Earlier, officials confirmed that Hyundai Heavy was on strike. It was not clear if workers at Korea Tacoma had joined in.</p>
</text>
